{"id":"8f4e7f4b6a171c26","group":"28","path":"28/28-thm-pit-randomized-test.md","title":"随机评价对恒零多项式的单边检测界","display":"thm-pit-randomized-test — 随机评价对恒零多项式的单边检测界","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-thm-pit-randomized-test","aliases":["28-thm-pit-randomized-test"],"display":"thm-pit-randomized-test — 随机评价对恒零多项式的单边检测界","depends_on":["[[28-df-arithmetic-circuit]]"],"source_book_location":"Example 20.1; Schwartz–Zippel application","source_printed_pages":"402–403","source_pdf_pages":"428–429","source_status":"statement-compared-local-formalization","source_proof_reviewed":false,"local_proof_reviewed":true,"eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"revision":"R5","verification_status":"proved-in-note; source-statement-compared"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-thm-pit-randomized-test"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-thm-pit-randomized-test</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-pit-randomized-test — 随机评价对恒零多项式的单边检测界"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"10115bca0ef04fef\" href=\"?note=10115bca0ef04fef\" title=\"28-df-arithmetic-circuit\">28-df-arithmetic-circuit</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_book_location","html":"Example 20.1; Schwartz–Zippel application"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"402–403"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"428–429"},{"key":"source_status","html":"statement-compared-local-formalization"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"},{"key":"local_proof_reviewed","html":"true"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"revision","html":"R5"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note; source-statement-compared"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb F\">\\(\\mathbb F\\)</span> 为域，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(d\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\in\\mathbf{ArithCirc}_{\\mathbb F,n}\">\\(C\\in\\mathbf{ArithCirc}_{\\mathbb F,n}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p=\\operatorname{poly}(C)\">\\(p=\\operatorname{poly}(C)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"10115bca0ef04fef\" href=\"?note=10115bca0ef04fef\" title=\"28-df-arithmetic-circuit\">28-df-arithmetic-circuit</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\subseteq\\mathbb F\">\\(S\\subseteq\\mathbb F\\)</span> 有限非空，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\deg p\\le d\">\\(\\deg p\\le d\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\deg0=-\\infty\">\\(\\deg0=-\\infty\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S^n\">\\(S^n\\)</span> 上均匀。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"p=0\\Longrightarrow\\Pr[p(X)=0]=1,\\qquad p\\ne0\\Longrightarrow\\Pr[p(X)=0]\\le\\frac d{|S|}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[p=0\\Longrightarrow\\Pr[p(X)=0]=1,\\qquad p\\ne0\\Longrightarrow\\Pr[p(X)=0]\\le\\frac d{|S|}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"|S|\\ge3\\max\\{d,1\\}\\Longrightarrow\\left(p\\ne0\\Rightarrow\\Pr[p(X)\\ne0]\\ge\\frac23\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[|S|\\ge3\\max\\{d,1\\}\\Longrightarrow\\left(p\\ne0\\Rightarrow\\Pr[p(X)\\ne0]\\ge\\frac23\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本地证明按一元根数界对变量数归纳：最后变量最高次数 k 的首项系数在其余变量上有至多 (d−k)/|S| 的零概率，其余情形最后变量至多 k 个根；两项相加得 d/|S|。电路拓扑求值计算 p(X)。这里只核验抽象随机评价的错误率；对指数次数的整数电路证明 coRP 位复杂度还需要取模和素数抽样，不能由本项单独推出。</p>\n<p>来源：所给 Arora–Barak PDF，Example 20.1; Schwartz–Zippel application；印刷页 402–403；PDF 页 428–429。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-arithmetic-circuit","status":"resolved","id":"10115bca0ef04fef","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-arithmetic-circuit]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-arithmetic-circuit","status":"resolved","id":"10115bca0ef04fef","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathbb F$ 为域，$n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}$，$d\\in\\mathbb N$，$C\\in\\mathbf{ArithCirc}_{\\mathbb F,n}$，$p=\\operatorname{poly}(C)$ 见 [[28-df-arithmetic-circuit]]。$S\\subseteq\\mathbb F$ 有限非空，$\\deg p\\le d$，其中 $\\deg0=-\\infty$，$X$ 在 $S^n$ 上均匀。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbb F","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}","display":false},{"tex":"d\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"C\\in\\mathbf{ArithCirc}_{\\mathbb F,n}","display":false},{"tex":"p=\\operatorname{poly}(C)","display":false},{"tex":"S\\subseteq\\mathbb F","display":false},{"tex":"\\deg p\\le d","display":false},{"tex":"\\deg0=-\\infty","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"S^n","display":false},{"tex":"p=0\\Longrightarrow\\Pr[p(X)=0]=1,\\qquad p\\ne0\\Longrightarrow\\Pr[p(X)=0]\\le\\frac d{|S|}.","display":true},{"tex":"|S|\\ge3\\max\\{d,1\\}\\Longrightarrow\\left(p\\ne0\\Rightarrow\\Pr[p(X)\\ne0]\\ge\\frac23\\right).","display":true}],"bytes":1787,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-382","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[28-df-e-class]]、[[28-df-polynomial-identity-testing]]、[[28-thm-uniform-derandomization]]、[[28-thm-pit-randomized-test]]、[[28-thm-pit-derandomization-lower-bound]]。"}],"outgoing":["10115bca0ef04fef"]}